libsmf
------------------------------------------
LibSMF is a BSD-licensed C library for handling SMF files. It transparently
handles conversions between time and pulses, tempo map handling etc.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  cygwin-devel-3.6.11-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libreadline8-8.3-1
  libsmf-devel-1.3-1bl5
  libsmf0-1.3-1bl5
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libreadline-devel-8.3-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/libsmf/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/libsmf/libsmf-1.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libsmf-1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libsmf-1.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libsmf-1.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsmf-1.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsmf0-1.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsmf-devel-1.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libsmf)
  /usr/bin/smfsh.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libsmf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libsmf/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libsmf/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libsmf/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/smfsh.1.gz

(libsmf0)
  /usr/bin/cygsmf-0.dll

(libsmf-devel)
  /usr/include/smf.h
  /usr/lib/libsmf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/smf.pc

------------------

